<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104053" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνω</span>; cf. Skt. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>apa-citis</i> 'vengeance')
				<i>payment by way of return</i> or <i>recompense,
				retribution, vengeance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				210
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				23.36
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ γὰρ Ὀρέσταο τ.
				ἔσσεται Ἀτρεΐδαο</span>
			<i>retribution for</i> his murder, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.40
			</span></i>; freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίσιν δοῦναί τινος</span>
			suffer <i>punishment for</i> an act, <i><span class="en">
				8.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίσιν τινὶ ἐκτεῖσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἥξει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.152
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				228
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρίη τε καὶ τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.8
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς
				κασιγνήτου τίσιν</span>
			<i>for</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1329
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τοιούτων τ</span>.
				<i>retribution for</i> such things, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				870d
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀροίτεα Πολυκράτεος τίσιες
				μετῆλθον</span> (where it may be personified,
			<i>avengers</i> of P., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύες</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>power to repay</i> or <i>requite</i>, both in bad and good
			sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					337
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				345
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
